  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "hello,\napparently that pesky Unity bug\nhttps://issuetracker.unity3d.com/issues/material-is-applied-to-two-slots-when-applying-material-to-a-single-slot-while-recording-animation\nthat was plaguing avatar creators trying to animate material changes on more complex avatars (more details in the link) was backported to v2019.4.39f1.\ni can confirm it now works fine in v2019.4.40f1.\nis there any chance of VRC getting a small update to v2019.4.39f1, or whatever the newest v2019.* will be at the time?",
